n V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|{-}|\">\\(|{-}|\\)</span> is the cardinality operator (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSilverCondition}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSilverCondition}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}silver\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingSilverCondition}_S(p) \\leftrightarrow p\\in2^{\\operatorname{dom}(p)}\\land \\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq\\omega\\land |\\omega\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(p)|=\\aleph_0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}silver\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingSilverCondition}_S(p) \\leftrightarrow p\\in2^{\\operatorname{dom}(p)}\\land \\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq\\omega\\land |\\omega\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(p)|=\\aleph_0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Silver condition is a partial binary function on <span clas